    "Identifiable apps with a proxy rule send port 53 queries to this resolver through their proxy over TCP. A failed query is blocked. Queries attributed only to the system use system DNS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可识别且走代理的 App 会通过代理，以 TCP 向此服务器发送 53 端口的 DNS 查询。查询失败时会阻断。仅归属到系统的查询仍由系统解析。"
          }
