            "state": "translated",
            "value": "状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopping…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在停止…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch Proxy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换代理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test Connection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The configuration is disabled": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配置已被禁用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The configuration is out of date. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配置已过期，请重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The default action proxies through \"%@\" on this Mac. Add a Direct rule for the local proxy client (such as Clash or v2ray); otherwise its own outgoing traffic is proxied again and loops.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认动作是代理到本机的「%@」。请给本机的代理客户端（如 Clash、v2ray）添加一条「直连」规则，否则它自己的出站流量会被再次代理，形成回环。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The extension did not respond": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩展无响应"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The extension failed to start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩展启动失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The extension is not running": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩展未运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The proxy is off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理未运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The proxy session keeps disconnecting, so automatic reconnection has stopped. Check the logs, then turn it on again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理会话反复断开，已停止自动重连。请查看日志后手动启用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The request was canceled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请求已取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The system extension entitlement is missing. Check the signing configuration (Config/Signing.xcconfig).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缺少系统扩展 entitlement，请检查签名配置（Config/Signing.xcconfig）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The system extension failed validation (signature, Info.plist or entitlements do not match).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统扩展校验失败（签名、Info.plist 或 entitlement 不匹配）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The system extension was not found inside the app. Rebuild it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 内没有找到系统扩展，请重新构建。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are no proxy servers yet. Add one under Proxy Servers first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有代理服务器，请先到「代理服务器」中添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These apps already have rules and were skipped: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下应用已有规则，已跳过：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作不可撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This stops the proxy and removes the proxy configuration and the network extension from macOS. Your rules and servers are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会停止代理并从系统中移除代理配置和网络扩展。你的规则和服务器配置会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tip: press ⌘⇧G to type a path, such as /usr/bin/curl or /opt/homebrew/bin/git": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示：按 ⌘⇧G 可以输入路径，例如 /usr/bin/curl 或 /opt/homebrew/bin/git"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "累计 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Traffic forwarded by the extension this session": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次会话中由扩展转发的流量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn Off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "类型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UDP": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UDP"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UDP bypasses the proxy and may reveal your real IP address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UDP 不经过代理，可能暴露真实 IP。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UDP for the default action": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认动作的 UDP 流量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UDP traffic": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UDP 流量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UDP will be relayed with SOCKS5 UDP ASSOCIATE.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UDP 将通过 SOCKS5 UDP ASSOCIATE 转发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uninstall": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卸载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uninstall Extension…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卸载扩展…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uninstall the network extension?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卸载网络扩展？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown configuration error": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未知配置错误"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unmatched Apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未匹配的应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upload": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上传"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uploaded %@ · Downloaded %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "累计上传 %1$@ · 累计下载 %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upstream connections bypass other VPN / TUN": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上游连接绕过其他 VPN / TUN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Username": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用户名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VPN and proxy cores (such as Clash's) bind their own connections to the physical interface to escape their TUN. Taking such a connection over drops the binding and creates a loop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VPN / 代理内核（如 Clash 内核）会把自己的连接绑定到物理网卡来绕开 TUN；这类连接被接管后会丢失绑定，形成回环。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for your approval in System Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待你在系统设置中允许"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warnings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "警告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, rules can choose \"Relay via SOCKS5\" for UDP. Dante, Shadowsocks local clients and Clash usually support it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，规则的 UDP 策略可选择「经 SOCKS5 转发」。Dante、Shadowsocks 本地端、Clash 等通常支持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, the extension reaches proxy servers over the physical interface, so tools like Clash do not process that traffic again. Leave it off if your proxy server is only reachable through a company VPN.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，扩展直接经物理网卡连接代理服务器，不会再被 Clash 等工具处理一次。如果代理服务器只能通过公司 VPN 访问，请不要开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the destination is a fake IP in 198.18.0.0/15 and no hostname is known, a remote proxy cannot connect; the connection goes back to the tool that issued the fake IP. Proxies on this Mac are not affected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标是 198.18.0.0/15 的 fake-IP、又拿不到域名时，远程代理无法连接；这时把连接交还给制造 fake-IP 的工具处理。上游代理在本机时不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the proxy is unavailable": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理不可用时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With UDP blocked, apps can retry over TCP. If an app reports a QUIC error, check the proxy connection and try disabling QUIC in the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "阻断 UDP 后，应用可以改用 TCP 重试。如果应用报 QUIC 错误，请检查代理连通性，并尝试在应用中关闭 QUIC。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works with .app bundles and command-line tools such as curl and git": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持 .app 和命令行工具（如 curl、git）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "e.g. Office proxy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：公司代理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "· running for %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· 已运行 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
